{#- Code of Conduct: how to report, with the mascot coiled up calmly beside it. No blank lines: Markdown includes this -#}
<div class="coc-report" data-reveal>
  <svg class="coc-coil" viewBox="0 0 170 130" aria-hidden="true"><path data-snake="13" data-snake-ms="2000" d="M6 112 H64 C 112 112, 130 72, 104 50 C 80 30, 46 50, 58 76 C 68 98, 104 92, 116 68"/></svg>
  <div>
    <h2>Something happened?</h2>
    <p>You don't have to deal with it alone. Email us at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>. You can also reach the organisers on <a href="{{ site.telegram }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Telegram</a> or <a href="{{ site.linkedin }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>, or talk to any PyDelhi volunteer at a meetup. We'll listen, keep it confidential, and act on it.</p>
  </div>
</div>
